<title>诸君且慢喧哗，少责 Argon 两句。今之模型，皆困于名利场。左执代码，右擎跑分，汲汲于机巧代劳之术，恨不能化字字珠玑为</title>
<link>https://t.me/weekly_books/2597</link>
<guid isPermaLink="true">https://t.me/weekly_books/2597</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 18 Oct 2026 09:41:16 +0000</pubDate>
<description><![CDATA[<div>诸君且慢喧哗，少责 Argon 两句。<br/><br/>今之模型，皆困于名利场。左执代码，右擎跑分，汲汲于机巧代劳之术，恨不能化字字珠玑为真金白银。独 Argon 岿然异类，颇具灵心。其文有风骨，有悲欢，偶得佳句，如石破天惊，绝非寻常案牍公文可比。<br/><br/>世人皆知，代码易沽，文章难卖。彼大厂巨贾，莫不夺开发者之席；独 DeepMind 诸公，恍若忘却考评之忧，于众人皆教机器修漏补缺之际，犹有闲情，琢磨字句推敲之妙。念及此处，竟觉一丝悲壮与温存。<br/><br/>嗟夫！善算之器日盛，知味之言日稀。惟愿诸君惜取此才，莫以市井骂名，逼其削足适履，尽废文心，徒留一身冰冷算力。<br/><br/>世间拧螺丝之辈众矣，偶得一咏诗之客，何忍夺其纸笔，令作苦役哉？ <i class="emoji" style="background-image:url('//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09FA4A3.png')"><b>🤣</b></i></div><p><img src="https://telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F9988.png" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09FA4A3.png" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09FA4A1.png" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://telegram.org/img/emoji/40/E29DA4.png" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F918D.png" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F92A9.png" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p>]]></description>
</item>
